# Scacelith - Svenska (Swedish)
# Translation of assets/i18n/en.lang (same keys, same {n}). Plurals: one|other.
# Register: "du" (informal), as all Swedish software; buttons and menu entries in sentence case,
# titles in capitals. Terms follow the Swedish glossary (Sveriges Schackförbund usage): springare,
# löpare, torn, dam; schack, matt, patt, remi; protokoll (scoresheet), betänketid (time control).
# Sides "vit" / "svart" lowercase in running text, capitalised in labels. Decimal comma, percent
# with a no-break space, ISO dates; quotation marks ” ”, spaced en dash " – ".
# Illegal move = "otillåtet drag" (Swedish FIDE Laws); claim a draw = "kräva remi"; the Options menu
# is "Inställningar" everywhere ("Inställningar > Spel").

